<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher, techs surge.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher, techs surge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened higher despite mild weakness in bonds as Dow's ferocious bull trend continues. Nasdaq surged on strength in techs, and a one point rise in IBM boosted Dows.</p>
<p>--Dow industrials up 9.69 to 6428.16</p>
<p>--NASDAQ Index up 5.34 to 1263.42</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index up 0.94 to 743.69</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline 413/356</p>
<p>--NASDAQ advance/decline 869/707</p>
<p>--Long bond off 3/32 to yield 6.43 pct.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1721</p>
</text>
